OL,3,GNEWSAMemory cafe to help support people
OL,4,Awith dementia
OL,5,
OL,6,FA support unit is opening in a Hull
OL,7,Fshopping centre to provide help and
OL,8,Fguidance to people with dementia.
OL,10,FThe "memory cafe" in Princes Quay aims
OL,11,Fto provide a "safe and accessible space
OL,12,Ffor those with dementia, but also for
OL,13,Ftheir carers and their families", one
OL,14,Fof its founders Mandi Allen said.
OL,16,FShe was inspired to set up the facility
OL,17,Fafter her experience in caring for her
OL,18,Fmother who died from dementia earlier
OL,19,Fthis year after "struggling to find
OL,20,Fplaces for mum to take her to".
